  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation achieve 0.65 accuracy. This experiment tests combining RNA and image data (multimodal) using scvi_n200 and resnet50, with avgpool (proven effective for RNA) and concat fusion (to isolate modality interaction effects). It balances exploration of multimodal benefits with leveraging prior RNA success."
}

